// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 2 Marauder :
"P1079642149" "<color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>It's go time!"
// 5 Marauder :
"P2609831131" "<color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>These grunts must think they've got what it takes to bring down the Big Dog!?"
// 6 Caption :
"P1822330804" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color LightGrey><bgcolor DarkRed>We are ready for deployment on your command, Praetor White!"
// 6 Caption :
"P2247373619" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Well, then what are you waiting for?! Let's light 'em up!"
// 6 Caption :
"P199580973" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color LightGrey><bgcolor DarkRed>Yes sir! Engaging the teleportation beacons now! Estimated time until reinforcements arrive is 30 seconds!"
// 6 Marauder :
"P2120209215" "<color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Good stuff. Now let's see if this serum from Praetor Berry is all he said it was."
// 6 Marauder :
"P747008069" "<color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Raaaaarrrr! Yeah! That's what I was hopin' for! These punks won't know what hit 'em."
// 6 Caption :
"P116055138" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color LightGrey><bgcolor DarkRed>We're online sir! Deployment begins now!"
// 6 Marauder :
"P215867997" "<color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Get those punks out here then! No one comes into my house and lives to tell about it! Let's do this!"
